  - m_Id: 136808528593170434
    m_Localized: "<color=#4B4E6D>2</color>      Laipni l\u016Bdzam Cargor!\n<color=#4B4E6D>3</color>     
      Pamata kust\u012Bba\n<color=#4B4E6D>4</color>      K\u0101 iepakot preces\n<color=#4B4E6D>5</color>     
      Novieto\u0161ana plauktos\n<color=#4B4E6D>6</color>      Kravas automa\u0161\u012Bnas
      un pieg\u0101de\n<color=#4B4E6D>7</color>       Klienti\n<line-height=18><color=#4B4E6D>8</color>     
      \u012Apa\u0161i piepras\u012Bjumi: atgrie\u0161ana,\ndubultie pas\u016Bt\u012Bjumi,
      jaukti kravas auto</line-height>\n<color=#4B4E6D>9</color>      \u012Are un
      j\u016Bsu nauda\n<color=#4B4E6D>10</color>   Uzlabojumi\n<color=#4B4E6D>11</color>   
      Uzdevumu d\u0113lis\n<color=#4B4E6D>12</color>    T\u0101lru\u0146a l\u012Bnija\n<color=#4B4E6D>13</color>   
      Atp\u016Btas telpa un dienas beigas\n<color=#4B4E6D>14</color>    Padomi komandas
      darbam"
