    m_Localized: Nauda
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269394388168704
    m_Localized: "<b> Uzman\u012Bbu! </b> Uzman\u012Bbu: ja kastes kr\u0101sa neatbilst
      produktam, iepako\u0161ana neizdodas un kaste sapl\u012Bst tav\u0101 rok\u0101.
      P\u0101rbaudi kr\u0101su pirms iepako\u0161anas \u2014 net\u0113r\u0113 kasti
      velt\u012Bgi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269394430111744
    m_Localized: "<b> Padoms: </b>Me\u0161ana un \u0137er\u0161ana ietaupa laiku
      divu cilv\u0113ku stacij\u0101, bet nepadari to par ieradumu \u2014 katra nome\u0161ana
      tev maks\u0101."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605470711808
    m_Localized: "PLAUKTU K\u0100RTO\u0160ANA"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605474906112
    m_Localized: "Plaukti ir Cargor dz\u012Bv\u012Bbas asinsvads. Tr\u012Bs tuk\u0161u
      kastu veidi \u2014 sarkans, dzeltens un zils \u2014 vienm\u0113r tur gaida;
      kad pa\u0146em vienu, plaukts dr\u012Bz vien atjaunojas, t\u0101p\u0113c tas
      nekad nepaliek piln\u012Bgi tuk\u0161s. Ja tev ir liek\u0101 kaste vai iesai\u0146ots
      produkts, ko pa\u0161laik nev\u0113lies n\u0113s\u0101t, vari to nolikt atpaka\u013C
      plaukt\u0101. Sak\u0101rtots plaukts atvieglo darbu gan tev, gan tavai komandai
      \u2014 ikviens zina, kur ko atrast."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605474906113
    m_Localized: "K\u0100 TIEK IEPAKOTI PRODUKTI"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605474906114
    m_Localized: "PAMATA KUST\u012ABAS"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605483294720
    m_Localized: "<b>Iet / Skriet</b> \u2013 \u013Cauj p\u0101rvietoties pa noliktavu.\n\n<b>Pacelt
      / Nolikt</b> \u2013 pa\u0146em priek\u0161metu no gr\u012Bdas, galda vai plaukta,
      vai noliec to tur, kur st\u0101vi.\n\n<b>Mest</b> \u2013 aizmet t\u0101lu to,
      ko turi. \u0100tri, bet riskanti: ja tas atsitas pret kaut ko cietu, tas sapl\u012Bst,
      un tu zaud\u0113 naudu un reput\u0101ciju. Ja to met komandas biedram, kur\u0161
      to no\u0137er, soda nav \u2014 tas pat ietaupa laiku.\n\n<b>Mijiedarb\u012Bba</b>
      \u2013 run\u0101\u0161ana ar klientiem, telefona pacel\u0161ana, priek\u0161metu
      \u0146em\u0161ana no plaukta/galda \u2014 viss notiek ar \u0161o pogu.\n\n<b>Karte
      / Kr\u0101jumu p\u0101rbaude</b> \u2013 atver noliktavas p\u0101rskatu, lai
      redz\u0113tu, kas kur atrodas. T\u0101 ner\u0101da komandas biedru poz\u012Bcijas
      \u2014 tas j\u0101prasa pa r\u0101ciju."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605483294721
    m_Localized: "K\u0100 TIEK\r\nIEPAKOTI\r\nPRODUKTI"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605483294722
    m_Localized: "Kad run\u0101 ar klientu, tas l\u016Bdz produktu un atst\u0101j
      to uz sava galda. Ar to darbs nebeidzas \u2014 produkts v\u0113l nav iepakots.\n\nIepako\u0161anas
      so\u013Ci:\n\nPa\u0146em klienta atst\u0101to neiesai\u0146oto produktu.\n\nDodies
      uz tuv\u0101ko iepako\u0161anas galdu.\n\nPa\u0146em no plaukta tuk\u0161u
      kasti t\u0101d\u0101 pa\u0161\u0101 kr\u0101s\u0101 k\u0101 produkts.\n\nApvieno
      produktu un kasti uz galda \u2014 vispirms apl\u012Bm\u0113 ar l\u012Bmlenti,
      tad uzl\u012Bm\u0113 eti\u0137eti, un pakete gatava.\n\nTagad tev ir iepakota
      kaste. N\u0101kam\u0101 ir pieg\u0101de (skat\u012Bt 6. lappusi)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859394301952
    m_Localized: Klienti
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859406884864
    m_Localized: "Cargor var sp\u0113l\u0113t ar\u012B vienatn\u0113, bet \u012Bst\u0101
      jautr\u012Bba s\u0101kas komand\u0101. Da\u017Ei praktiski padomi:\n\n- <b>Sadaliet
      darbu:</b> lai viens paliek pie iepako\u0161anas galda, viens skrien pie kravas
      ma\u0161\u012Bn\u0101m, viens r\u016Bp\u0113jas par klientiem.\n- <b>Run\u0101jiet
      sav\u0101 starp\u0101: </b>ja neesat vien\u0101 telp\u0101, iesp\u0113jams,
      ka neredzat viens otru \u2014 p\u0101rbaudiet karti un ska\u013Ci dalieties,
      kas kur atrodas.\n- <b>Metiet un \u0137eriet:</b> t\u0101 viet\u0101, lai skrietu
      turp un atpaka\u013C starp div\u0101m stacij\u0101m, met kasti tie\u0161i komandas
      biedram.\n- <b>Vienojieties par uzlabojumiem:</b> past\u0101v\u012Bgas izv\u0113les
      ietekm\u0113 visus, nelem viens pats.\n\nVeiksmi \u2014 laipni l\u016Bdzam
      Cargor!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859411079168
    m_Localized: "Laipni l\u016Bdzam Cargor!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859411079169
    m_Localized: "T\u0101lru\u0146a L\u012Bnija"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859411079170
    m_Localized: "T\u0101lrunis noliktav\u0101 laiku pa laikam zvana. Ej to pacelt,
      lai ieg\u016Btu nelielu naudas un reput\u0101cijas balvu. Ja nepace\u013C,
      ar\u012B neko nezaud\u0113 \u2014 t\u0101lrunis pats galu gal\u0101 apklust.\n\nVai
      tas zvan\u012Bs, ir piln\u012Bb\u0101 atkar\u012Bgs no nejau\u0161\u012Bbas,
      bet da\u017E\u0101s dien\u0101s (piem\u0113ram, \u012Bpa\u0161u notikumu dien\u0101s)
      iesp\u0113jam\u012Bba palielin\u0101s. Paskat\u012Bties gar\u0101m ejot nekait\u0113."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273472
    m_Localized: "<b> Padoms:  </b>Dienai tuvojoties beig\u0101m, pabeidz to, ko
      dari, un dodies agri uz atp\u016Btas telpu \u2014 neliec komandai gaid\u012Bt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273473
    m_Localized: "\u012Apa\u0161i Piepras\u012Bjumi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273474
    m_Localized: "<b> Padoms:  </b>Neizv\u0113lies bez sarunas ar komandu \u2014
      viena cilv\u0113ka izv\u0113l\u0113ts uzlabojums maina visu sp\u0113li."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273475
    m_Localized: "Katru dienu pie zi\u0146ojumu d\u0113\u013Ca redz\u0113si vair\u0101kus
      uzdevumus \u2014 piem\u0113ram, kastes salik\u0161anu plaukt\u0101, produkta
      iepako\u0161anu, kravas ma\u0161\u012Bnas piepild\u012B\u0161anu vai t\u0101lru\u0146a
      pacel\u0161anu. Dien\u0101 vari pie\u0146emt tikai vienu.\n\n- Ja pabeidz pie\u0146emto
      uzdevumu pirms dienas beig\u0101m, tava balva tiek autom\u0101tiski ieskait\u012Bta
      dienas beig\u0101s.\n\n- Ja to pie\u0146em un atst\u0101j nepabeigtu, dienas
      beig\u0101s seko sods.\n\nJa nepie\u0146em nevienu, nekas nenotiek \u2014 bet
      tu ar\u012B palaid gar\u0101m iesp\u0113ju. Izv\u0113lies uzdevumu, kas ir
      re\u0101listisks attiec\u012Bb\u0101 pret to, ko tobr\u012Bd dari."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273476
    m_Localized: Komandas Darba Padomi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273477
    m_Localized: "\u012Are un Tava Nauda"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859419467776
    m_Localized: "Cargor uztur\u0113\u0161ana nav bez maksas. Noteikt\u0101s dien\u0101s
      pien\u0101k \u012Bres maks\u0101jums \u2014 \u0161o dienu sauc par \"\u012Bres
      dienu\".\n\n- Ja tev ir pietiekami daudz naudas \u012Brei, t\u0101 tiek samaks\u0101ta,
      un tu turpini.\n\n- Ja termi\u0146\u0101 nevari samaks\u0101t, tev ir vienreiz\u0113ja
      otr\u0101 izdev\u012Bba: liel\u0101k\u0101 da\u013Ca tavas skaidras naudas
      tiek at\u0146emta, bet uz\u0146\u0113mums neaizveras.\n\n<b>Nauda </b>n\u0101k
      no pareiz\u0101m pieg\u0101d\u0113m, telefona zvaniem un pabeigtiem uzdevumiem.
      Nepareizas pieg\u0101des, nomestas kastes un nepabeigti uzdevumi at\u0146em
      tev naudu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859419467777
    m_Localized: "<b> Neaizmirsti:  </b>tu neesi \u0161eit viens. Cargor ir komandas
      darbs \u2014 dalies ar slodzi, dari zin\u0101mu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859419467778
    m_Localized: "Pieg\u0101d\u0101 pareizo kr\u0101su \u2192 tu nopelni naudu, tava
      reput\u0101cija paaugstin\u0101s.\n\nPieg\u0101d\u0101 nepareizo kr\u0101su
      \u2192 tu zaud\u0113 naudu. P\u0101rbaudi kr\u0101sas divreiz.\n\nKatrai kravas
      ma\u0161\u012Bnai ir ierobe\u017Eots gaid\u012B\u0161anas laiks un ietilp\u012Bba.
      Kad t\u0101 ir pilna vai laiks beidzies, kravas ma\u0161\u012Bna aizbrauc,
      un ierodas jauna.\n\nPieaugot noliktavai (ar uzlabojumiem), var atv\u0113rties
      vair\u0101ki ang\u0101ri \u2014 tad vari apkalpot vair\u0101kas kravas ma\u0161\u012Bnas
      vienlaikus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859427856384
    m_Localized: "<b> Padoms:  </b>Neiekr\u012Bti panik\u0101, ieraugot jauktu kravas
      ma\u0161\u012Bnu vai dubultu pas\u016Bt\u012Bjumu \u2014 vienk\u0101r\u0161i
      uztver to k\u0101 divas atsevi\u0161\u0137as pieg\u0101des un veic t\u0101s
      p\u0113c k\u0101rtas."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859427856385
    m_Localized: Uzlabojumi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859427856386
    m_Localized: "Kad diena beidzas, visiem j\u0101dodas uz atp\u016Btas telpu. Pat
      ja tikai viens cilv\u0113ks paliek \u0101r\u0101, diena neaizveras \u2014 gaida,
      kam\u0113r visa komanda sapulc\u0113jas.\n\nKad visi ir telp\u0101, par\u0101d\u0101s
      dienas kopsavilkums, un s\u0101kas jauna diena. Ja tu sasniedz se\u0161padsmit\u0101s
      dienas beigas bez bankrota, esi nopeln\u012Bjis svin\u012Bbas."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859432050688
    m_Localized: "Atp\u016Btas Telpa un Dienas Beigas"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859432050689
    m_Localized: "Klienti ien\u0101k pa durv\u012Bm, nost\u0101jas rind\u0101 un
      l\u016Bdz tev kaut ko. Josla virs vi\u0146iem r\u0101da, cik paciet\u012Bgi
      vi\u0146i ir \u2014 kad t\u0101 izbeidzas, klients dusm\u012Bgi aiziet, un
      tu zaud\u0113 naudu un reput\u0101ciju.\n\n- Noslodze main\u0101s dienas laik\u0101:
      pusdienlaiks un vakars ir vissasprindzin\u0101t\u0101kie br\u012B\u017Ei, p\u0113cpusdien\u0101
      tev ir mazliet atvieglojuma.\n\n- Kad run\u0101 ar klientu (mijiedarb\u012Bbas
      poga), vi\u0146\u0161 atst\u0101j v\u0113lamo produktu uz sava galda \u2014
      p\u0113c tam seko iepako\u0161ana un pieg\u0101de (4.-6. lappuse).\n\n- Katrs
      laik\u0101 apkalpots klients tev nes gan naudu, gan reput\u0101ciju. Jo augst\u0101ka
      tava reput\u0101cija, jo vair\u0101k nopelni par pieg\u0101di."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859436244992
    m_Localized: "<b> Padoms:  </b>Neatliec gr\u016Btu uzdevumu uz p\u0113d\u0113jo
      dienu. Dienas beigas vienm\u0113r pien\u0101k \u0101tr\u0101k, nek\u0101 dom\u0101."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859436244993
    m_Localized: "Atgrie\u0161ana, Dubultie Pas\u016Bt\u012Bjumi, Jaukt\u0101s Kravas
      Ma\u0161\u012Bnas"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859436244994
    m_Localized: "<b> Padoms:  </b>Ja t\u0101lrunis zvana un tas ir pa ce\u013Cam,
      iegriezies pat ar piln\u0101m rok\u0101m \u2014 \u012Bss p\u0101rtraukums,
      neliels ieguvums."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633600
    m_Localized: "LAIPNI L\u016ADZAM!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633601
    m_Localized: "Uzdevumu D\u0113lis"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633602
    m_Localized: "Dien\u0101m ejot, darbs k\u013C\u016Bst nedaudz sare\u017E\u0123\u012Bt\u0101ks.
      Tu sastapsies ar trim jaun\u0101m situ\u0101cij\u0101m:\n\n<b>Atgrie\u0161ana:
      </b>da\u017Ei klienti negrib produktu \u2014 glu\u017Ei pret\u0113ji, vi\u0146i
      l\u016Bdz, lai tu atnes vi\u0146iem kasti atpaka\u013C. Kr\u0101sain\u0101
      lode, kas par\u0101d\u0101s virs vi\u0146iem, r\u0101da, k\u0101das kr\u0101sas
      kasti vi\u0146i v\u0113las. Pa\u0146em pareizo kr\u0101su no plaukta un aiznes
      to klientam.\n\n<b>Dubultais pas\u016Bt\u012Bjums: </b>da\u017Ei klienti v\u0113las
      divas da\u017E\u0101das kr\u0101sas vienlaikus. Darbs nav pabeigts, kam\u0113r
      abas nav sagatavotas.\n\n<b>Jaukt\u0101 kravas ma\u0161\u012Bna: </b>da\u017Eas
      kravas ma\u0161\u012Bnas v\u0113las nevis vienu, bet divas da\u017E\u0101das
      kastu kr\u0101sas. Jaukt\u0101 kr\u0101sa uz virsb\u016Bves (piem\u0113ram,
      sarkans + dzeltens = oran\u017Es) dod tev nor\u0101di \u2014 t\u0101 r\u0101da,
      kuras divas kr\u0101sas j\u0101iekrauj."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633603
    m_Localized: "Ang\u0101r\u0101 gaido\u0161\u0101s kravas ma\u0161\u012Bnas ar
      virsb\u016Bves kr\u0101su r\u0101da, ko t\u0101s v\u0113las: sarkana kravas
      ma\u0161\u012Bna v\u0113las sarkanu kasti, dzeltena \u2014 dzeltenu, zila \u2014
      zilu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859448827904
    m_Localized: "Laipni l\u016Bdzam! Tagad tu esi da\u013Ca no Cargor \u0123imenes.
      \u0160\u012B vieta ir noliktava, veikals un mazliet haosa \u2014 viss vienuviet.\n\nKlienti
      past\u0101sta, ko vi\u0146i v\u0113las, tu to iepako un uzkrauj pareizaj\u0101
      kravas ma\u0161\u012Bn\u0101. Izklaus\u0101s vienk\u0101r\u0161i, vai ne? Ja
      p\u0113c se\u0161padsmit dien\u0101m joproj\u0101m st\u0101vi k\u0101j\u0101s,
      tu tie\u0161\u0101m esi labi padar\u012Bjis darbu.\n\n\u0160\u012B piez\u012Bmju
      gr\u0101mati\u0146a tav\u0101s rok\u0101s ir vieta, pie kuras atgriez\u012Bsies,
      kad aizmirs\u012Bsi smalkumus. Katra lappuse apraksta citu t\u0113mu. Nav j\u0101steidzas
      \u2014 pirmaj\u0101s dien\u0101s str\u0101d\u0101 l\u0113ni, iepaz\u012Bsti
      sist\u0113mu. \u0100trums n\u0101ks ar laiku."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859453022208
    m_Localized: "<b> Padoms:  </b>P\u0101rbaudi savu skaidru naudu pirms \u012Bres
      dien\u0101m. Neatst\u0101j to uz p\u0113d\u0113jo br\u012Bdi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859453022209
    m_Localized: "<b> Uzman\u012Bbu:  </b>Kam\u0113r rinda ir pilna, jauni klienti
      neierodas, bet tie, kas jau gaida, turpina zaud\u0113t paciet\u012Bbu. Nes\u0101c
      neko jaunu, kam\u0113r neesi iztuk\u0161ojis rindu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859453022210
    m_Localized: "<b> Padoms:  </b>Ja kravas ma\u0161\u012Bnas kr\u0101su vari saskat\u012Bt
      jau no t\u0101lienes, dod priek\u0161roku tai, kas atbilst kastei, ko nes \u2014
      nestaig\u0101 velti."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859461410816
    m_Localized: "KRAVAS MA\u0160\u012ANAS UN PIEG\u0100DE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859465605120
    m_Localized: "Noteikt\u0101s dien\u0101s tev tiek pied\u0101v\u0101tas vair\u0101kas
      uzlabojumu iesp\u0113jas \u2014 tu nevari \u0146emt visas, tu izv\u0113lies
      starp t\u0101m. Vari ieg\u016Bt past\u0101v\u012Bgus uzlabojumus, piem\u0113ram,
      papildu plauktu, papildu ang\u0101ru, \u0101tr\u0101ku kust\u012Bbu vai ilg\u0101ku
      klientu paciet\u012Bbu.\n\nR\u016Bp\u012Bgi apsver izv\u0113li: da\u017Ei uzlabojumi
      izsl\u0113dz viens otru, citi atblo\u0137\u0113jas tikai no noteiktas dienas.
      Izv\u0113les, kas pa\u0101trina pamatus pirmaj\u0101s dien\u0101s, v\u0113l\u0101k
      atmaks\u0101jas daudz vair\u0101k."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416780595200
    m_Localized: "Laipni l\u016Bdzam Cargor! Tu \u0146emsi pas\u016Bt\u012Bjumus
      no klientiem un pieg\u0101d\u0101si tos kravas automa\u0161\u012Bn\u0101m.
      Nospied [SPACE], lai turpin\u0101tu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416847704064
    m_Localized: "Ej pie klienta un nospied [{0}], tad v\u0113lreiz nospied [{0}]
      pie galda, lai pa\u0146emtu preci."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416847704065
    m_Localized: "Aiznes preci uz iepako\u0161anas galdu un nospied [{0}], lai to
      noliktu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092672
    m_Localized: "Nospied [{0}] pie plaukta, lai pa\u0146emtu pareizo kasti."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092673
    m_Localized: "Aiznes kasti uz iepako\u0161anas galdu un nospied [{0}] \u2014 prece non\u0101k kast\u0113, bet t\u0101 paliek atv\u0113rta, kam\u0113r to neaizl\u012Bm\u0113 ar l\u012Bmlenti."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263129
    m_Localized: "Nospied [{0}] pie l\u012Bmlentes stacijas, lai pa\u0146emtu l\u012Bmlentes ru\u013C\u013Cu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263130
    m_Localized: "Ar l\u012Bmlenti rok\u0101 nospied [{0}] pie iepako\u0161anas galda, lai aizl\u012Bm\u0113tu atv\u0113rto kasti."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092674
    m_Localized: "V\u0113lreiz nospied [{0}] pie galda, lai pa\u0146emtu aizl\u012Bm\u0113to kasti."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092675
    m_Localized: Nospied [{0}], lai noliktu kasti uz plaukta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092676
    m_Localized: "Kravas automa\u0161\u012Bna tuvojas, uzgaidi mazliet..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092677
    m_Localized: "V\u0113lreiz nospied [{0}] pie plaukta, lai pa\u0146emtu paku."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092678
    m_Localized: "Aiznes paku uz kravas automa\u0161\u012Bnas aizmuguri un iemet
      to iek\u0161\u0101."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092679
    m_Localized: Nospied [SPACE], lai izlaistu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416860286976
    m_Localized: "Tutori\u0101ls pabeigts!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
